zΔ⚡b|=414d|+<ref>{{Cite web%7Curl%3Dhttps://www.gnu.org/software/diffutils/manual/html_node/Detailed%2DUnified.html%7Ctitle%3DDetailed Description of Unified Format%7Cwebsite%3DGNU Diffutils (version 3.7, 7 January 2018)}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web%7Curl%3Dhttps://www.artima.com/weblogs/viewpost.jsp?thread%3D164293%7Ctitle%3DUnified Diff Format%7Clast%3Dvan Rossum%7Cfirst%3DGuido%7Cwebsite%3DAll Things Pythonic}}</ref>|=d1|+[[|=13|+]]|=2c|+[[|=6|+(Unix)%7Cpatch]] |=14f|+[[|=10|+]]|=23|+[[GNU%7C|=b|+]]|=ef|+[[Header (computing)%7C|=6|+]]|=151|+[[|=9|+]]|=27|+[[|=a|+]]|=c9|+[[|=7|+]]|=54|+[[#Context format%7C|=5|+]]|=564|+[[|=12|+]]|=a|+<ref>[https://www.gnu.org/software/diffutils/manual/html_node/Sections.html 2.2.3 Showing Which Sections Differences Are in], GNU diffutils manual</ref>|=bf|+<ref>[http://www.artima.com/weblogs/viewpost.jsp?thread%3D164293 Unified Diff Format] by [[Guido van Rossum]], June 14, 2006</ref>|=31|+<pre>%0A%2Dcheck this dokument. On%0A%2Bcheck this document. On%0A</pre>%0A%0A|=4d|+<syntaxhighlight lang%3D"diff">|=1|+%2D%2D%2D /path/to/original%09timestamp%0A%2B%2B%2B /path/to/new%09timestamp%0A@@ %2D1,3 %2B1,9 @@%0A%2BThis is an important%0A%2Bnotice! It should%0A%2Btherefore be located at%0A%2Bthe beginning of this%0A%2Bdocument!%0A%2B%0A This part of the%0A document has stayed the%0A same from version to%0A@@ %2D8,13 %2B14,8 @@%0A compress the size of the%0A changes.%0A%0A%2DThis paragraph contains%0A%2Dtext that is outdated.%0A%2DIt will be deleted in the%0A%2Dnear future.%0A%2D%0A It is important to spell%0A%2Dcheck this dokument. On%0A%2Bcheck this document. On%0A the other hand, a%0A misspelled word isn't%0A the end of the world.%0A@@ %2D22,3 %2B23,7 @@%0A this paragraph needs to%0A be changed. Things can%0A be added after it.%0A%2B%0A%2BThis paragraph contains%0A%2Bimportant new additions%0A%2Bto this document.%0A</syntaxhighlight>%0A{{Note2}} |=88|+[[|=a|+]]|=3f|+[[|=13|+]]|=17e|+[[|=10|+]]|=13|+[[|=a|+ (software)%7CSubversion]]|=227|+<ref>http://pubs.opengroup.org/onlinepubs/9699919799/basedefs/V1_chap03.html#tag_03_403 Section 3.206</ref>|=6|+[[Patch (Unix)%7C|=5|+]]|=2e5a|
