zΔ⚡b|=6298|+[https://github.com/dandavison/delta delta] displays diffs in various ways for visual consumption, including side%2Dby%2Dside format and with syntax%2Dhighlighting of the code fragments.%0A%0A[[delta]]<ref>{{Cite web%7Curl%3Dhttps://www.gnu.org/software/wdiff/wdiff.html%7Ctitle%3Dgnu.org%7Cwebsite%3Dwww.gnu.org}}</ref> is a front end to diff that shows the words or phrases that changed in a text document of written language even in the presence of word%2Dwrapping or different column widths.%0A%0A|=2607|
